 num_x,\n320\t            height,\n321\t            num_cosets,\n322\t            g_shift,\n323\t            max_temp_bytes,\n324\t        )?;\n325\t    }\n326\t\n327\t    Ok(s_evals)\n328\t}\n329\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01TgCGmSEnuBSewk3hVtVUqW","session_id":"b6755d07-23c8-46a3-81f0-36e3b63f2ed6","uuid":"c27e586e-48f9-4075-9be2-1cea923fef3d","timestamp":"2026-04-16T15:08:13.243Z"}
